{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/1a2erd","slideIndex":0,"text":"About 2 minutes. Welcome the teachers and leadership team. Today has two purposes: become comfortable using Kaizen and agree how Make It Count will support classroom teaching. School access is already arranged. Do not show or read passwords or access codes on the shared screen. Ask: Which part of lesson preparation takes most of your time? Keep one or two responses to revisit at the end. Presenter identity and programme context supplied by Dr Megel Barker in this conversation."}
