{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ewbumx","slideIndex":5,"text":"About 2 minutes. Ask teachers to name one resource or strategy they will use before the next meeting. Check that everyone has working access. Confirm the named school coordinator, participating teachers, the next session date and the agreed contact channel. Write these in your meeting notes rather than inventing them in advance. Close by returning to the planning need teachers named at the beginning. Keep a few minutes for questions if the demonstration finishes early. No session dates, school identity, access credentials or contact details have been assumed."}